measuring_overlay.png is a pixel-perfect boat-eye measuring grid.

It is a 1920x1080 frame whose measuring band is exactly 576px wide, 18 bands
of 32px, centred on x=960. Those numbers are what make it measurable: see
"Measuring window" in the README for the capture and destination geometry that
keeps one band equal to one game pixel.

You can generate your own for a different panel size with priffin's
Pixel-Perfect Tools:

    https://priffin.github.io/Pixel-Perfect-Tools/overlayGen.html

Whatever you generate has to satisfy the same two constraints, or the scale
drifts: a 60 game pixel capture, and a destination width that is a multiple
of 60.
